WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.605
Marcus: Same block. Same windows. But today, everything feels different.

2
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.575
Denise: Marcus. The car is downstairs. You got your notebook?

3
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.690
Marcus: Yeah, Ma. I got it.

4
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.039
Marcus: A new city does not mean a new me. Just a new place to be heard.

5
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:34.595
Denise: Then let us go find your next chapter.
